<h1>Password Reset Request</h1>

<p>Someone has requested that the password for "<%= @user.name %>" for the website <%= AdminConfig.instance.app_name %> be reset. If you did not request this, then you can ignore this email.</p>
<p>To reset your password, please visit <%= link_to("this link", edit_users_password_reset_url(host: GayFurCity.config.hostname, only_path: false, key: @nonce.key, uid: @nonce.user_id)) %>.</p>
